The '''Entralla Route''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that ran through [[the galaxy]]'s [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]].<ref name="BMF 48" /> The route ran from [[Muunilinst]] on the [[Braxant Run]]<ref name="GM" /> south to [[Ord Mantell]] in the [[Bright Jewel sector]],<ref name="Map">{{StarWarsGalaxyMap}}</ref> where it intersected with the [[Celanon Spur]]<ref name="BMF 48" /> and [[Burke's Trailing]] trade routes.<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The roleplaying sourcebook ''[[Nexus of Power]]'' incorrectly places [[Aleen]] on the Entralla Route,<ref name="Nexus">''[[Nexus of Power]]''</ref> but it is actually located along the [[Celanon Spur]].<ref name="Map" />

